{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome, everyone, to try out the demo version of <strong>Box Bakery</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes about one-quarter of the content from the first town in the main game. It's designed to give you a taste of the core gameplay and early story. Even after the full version of the game is officially released, this demo will remain available\u2014so players who are still deciding whether to purchase the full game can always come back for a little sample.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you can feel the atmosphere we\u2019ve worked hard to create in this demo. Enjoy your time in the bakery!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2947610?t=1747889647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947610/42747c0dac83c4bae673f2f59fd3804615e31c25/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747889647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947610/6449806af4ce13d0259615e14ad0a46f865912b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747889647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2947610/6449806af4ce13d0259615e14ad0a46f865912b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747889647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome, everyone, to try out the demo version of <strong>Box Bakery</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes about one-quarter of the content from the first town in the main game. It's designed to give you a taste of the core gameplay and early story. Even after the full version of the game is officially released, this demo will remain available\u2014so players who are still deciding whether to purchase the full game can always come back for a little sample.</p><p class=\"bb_pa